      "richText": [
        {
          "bold": false,
          "code": false,
          "href": null,
          "italic": false,
          "plainText": "Optiverse is a student-built mentorship project. No suits, no corporate off-site, just older students who've been through the noise helping younger ones figure out what they actually want."
        }
      ],
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "id": "653c6ed7-cdda-47e6-bc46-73b70516a220",
      "richText": [
        {
          "bold": false,
          "code": false,
          "href": null,
          "italic": false,
          "plainText": "We ran free 1-on-1 mentorship for students aged 10\u201318: self-reflection, honest conversation, zero pressure, a certificate at the end for the ones who like proof. Mentors were students too \u2014 scattered across 18+ countries, no salaries, just people who wanted to be useful."
        }
      ],
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "id": "fc0abdf0-4e61-4f24-8b45-d13e71389b12",
      "richText": [
        {
          "bold": false,
          "code": false,
          "href": null,
          "italic": false,
          "plainText": "Operations are paused indefinitely right now. Not dead \u2014 recharging. If you want in when it comes back, register and wait it out with us."
        }
      ],
      "type": "quote"
    },
